00:57:56.630 --> 00:58:02.460
<v Cop>Dead squirrel. Ruined pillows. Need a new couch. The walls are covered with soot. The fire alarms are going off.
<v Cop>死松鼠。毁掉的枕头。需要新沙发。墙壁覆盖着煤烟。火灾报警器响个不停。

00:58:02.460 --> 00:58:06.670
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回更多《美国生活》的故事。

00:58:06.670 --> 00:58:55.150
<v Cop>You really haven't done anything wrong. I mean, we did call you. But I just-- I can't thank you for this.
<v Cop>你真的没做错什么。我的意思是，确实是我们叫你们来的。但我只是，我没法为此感谢你们。

00:58:55.150 --> 00:59:00.150
<v Announcer>PRI, Public Radio International.
<v Announcer>PRI，国际公共广播电台。
